# Repository workflow

Read the root `AGENTS.md` before editing or reviewing code. It contains the shared
repository map, contracts, validation commands, and browser cleanup rules. Use
`docs/AI_WORKFLOW.md` for setup, focused checks, browser debugging (including
optional IronBee DevTools), and task handoffs. Keep durable instructions there
instead of duplicating them in this file.
